  "details": "A useful addition to the OSC parameters would be to either send the absolute position and rotation in the world to the application or allow it to request it.\nIt is technically possible to calculate it using the velocity, but this doesn't account for teleporting/respawning\nThis could come in handy for tools that allow you to find your friends in large worlds more easily.",
